[{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0081","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0081.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0097","title":"Microsoft Index Server 目录遍历漏洞","description":"Microsoft Index Server 2.0 及 Windows 2000 Indexing Service 中的 WebHits ISAPI 过滤器存在目录遍历漏洞，远程攻击者通过向目标系统发送特制的畸形 Hit-Highlighting 参数请求，可绕过路径限制读取服务器上的任意文件。该漏洞影响 Windows 2000 系统上运行的 Index Server 2.0 和 Indexing Service，CVSS 评分 5.0，属于中等危害等级。Microsoft 已在安全公告 MS00-006 中发布相关补丁修复此漏洞。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0097"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-01-26T05:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:50:59.673","remediation":"立即安装 Microsoft 安全公告 MS00-006 提供的补丁（KB251170），该补丁可消除 Index Server 2.0 / Windows 2000 Indexing Service 的 WebHits ISAPI 筛选器（.htw 映射）目录遍历漏洞。如无法安装补丁，可在 IIS 管理器中移除 .htw 应用程序映射，或直接删除 webbits.dll 及 httpext.dll ISAPI 筛选器注册项作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-21T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.osvdb.org/1210","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/950","https://docs.microsoft.com/en-us/security-updates/securitybulletins/2000/ms00-006","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/19731","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/3d8ee18720c8a74c03524a9994e81b2de7f6b0ec/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0097.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0097","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/7f1c35ad28226319c149c937b6a2e7a1986924ce/content/CVE-2000-0097.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/d67487551d3c04e5942b9b8e11c25937ecfba21c/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0097.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/136f8e11918ce66b2191bce34c9fdd746a45739c/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-726j-722q-69g3/GHSA-726j-722q-69g3.json","https://github.com/xqcyberscore/nvt/blob/978f6a9acb495d7d669239530ffe6da5d631f4da/2008/remote-MS00-006.nasl","https://github.com/jdkoftinoff/mb-linux-msli/blob/8adb103e34af9ff1d8d122e9ee2a1808836f0a14/uClinux-dist/user/nessus/nessus-plugins/scripts/ms_index_server.nasl","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/1c14ae4816efb67123e0664d061a6cbfe48f234b/nvdcve/CVE-2000-0097.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_152100_152200.json","https://github.com/andreafioraldi/ToolsForCyberChallenge/blob/197d3dfd204cf1b9d1af1451455c8831c3ff9948/generated/files_1.list.dict"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0081.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0080","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0080.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0096","title":"Qualcomm qpopper 3.0 LIST 命令远程缓冲区溢出漏洞","description":"Qualcomm qpopper 3.0 beta 版本 POP3 守护进程在处理 LIST 命令时存在缓冲区溢出漏洞。已通过身份认证的攻击者可通过向 TCP 端口 110 上的 POP3 服务发送超长特制的 LIST 命令参数，触发栈缓冲区溢出，导致攻击者能够以 qpopper 进程权限执行任意代码，实现本地权限提升。该漏洞 CVSS v2 评分 7.2，危害等级高，影响系统机密性、完整性和可用性。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.2,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0096"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-01-26T05:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:50:59.533","remediation":"升级至 qpopper 3.0 正式发布版（非 beta 版本）以修复 LIST 命令缓冲区溢出漏洞。由于 Qualcomm 已停止维护 qpopper，建议迁移至 Dovecot 等活跃维护的 POP3/IMAP 服务器。临时缓解措施包括限制本地用户对 qpopper 服务的访问权限，并通过系统审计日志监控异常的 LIST 命令请求。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-21T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/948","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/19729","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/72f387512fbbb3f0e46713b23cdbd1f9c533d1f7/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0096.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0096","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/7f1c35ad28226319c149c937b6a2e7a1986924ce/content/CVE-2000-0096.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/d67487551d3c04e5942b9b8e11c25937ecfba21c/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0096.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/0e291808cb617ccf4c842a91d82530cb507f8570/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-rp69-5w75-5xrq/GHSA-rp69-5w75-5xrq.json","https://github.com/blackhook/nessus-plugins/blob/64177d96abbb07c58cf7e131046b067ebc61fcb5/q/qpopper_list.nasl","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--67381bb6-5e61-4ed8-ada4-af1bc2e74f2e.json","https://github.com/andreafioraldi/ToolsForCyberChallenge/blob/197d3dfd204cf1b9d1af1451455c8831c3ff9948/generated/files_0.list.dict","https://github.com/leego972/titanai/blob/afa5b2310463aae5781d3fd9408071bf38e79806/data/raw/corpus_D_cyber/nvd_cve_001116.txt"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0080.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0114","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0114.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0126","title":"Microsoft IIS 3.0/4.0 目录遍历漏洞","description":"Microsoft IIS 3.0/4.0 及 Index Server 2.0 中的示例 Internet Data Query (IDQ) 脚本存在目录遍历漏洞。远程攻击者可通过向目标服务器发送包含 `..`（点点）序列的特制 HTTP 请求，绕过路径限制读取服务器上的任意文件，导致敏感信息泄露。该漏洞影响运行 Microsoft IIS 3.0/4.0 及 Index Server 2.0 的 Windows 系统，CVSS 评分 5.0，危害等级中等。Microsoft 已在安全公告 MS00-006 中发布修复补丁。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0126"],"sources":["cve"],"published":"2000-01-26","updated":"2026-06-16","remediation":"建议立即安装 Microsoft 安全公告 MS00-006 提供的补丁（Index Server 2.0 Intel 版下载地址见公告），或升级至 Windows 2000 及以上版本。如无法升级，可删除 IIS 中示例 IDQ 脚本文件（默认位于 /scripts/samples 目录），并禁用 .idq/.ida ISAPI 映射扩展。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/CVE-2000-0126","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/19742","https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/security-updates/securitybulletins/2000/ms00-006","https://nvd.nist.gov/vuln/detail/CVE-2000-0126"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0114.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0079","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0079.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0095","title":"HP HP-UX Path MTU Discovery 拒绝服务漏洞","description":"HP-UX 10.30 及 11.00 操作系统的路径 MTU 发现（PMTU discovery）机制存在设计缺陷，当接收到特定的小型数据包时，系统会生成大量响应流量，导致网络带宽被过度消耗。远程攻击者可利用该漏洞将目标主机作为流量放大反射器，实施分布式拒绝服务（DDoS）攻击，影响网络可用性。该漏洞无需认证即可利用，攻击门槛较低，对受影响系统所在网络环境构成严重威胁。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0095"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-01-24T05:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:50:59.420","remediation":"建议立即安装 HP 针对此漏洞发布的安全补丁（HP Security Bulletin HPSBUX0001-114），或升级至已修复的 HP-UX 11.0 后续版本。如无法打补丁，可执行 ndd -set /dev/ip ip_send_source_quench 0 禁用源端抑制，并在边界防火墙上限制外部发往 HP-UX 主机的 ICMP 不可达消息速率，从源头阻断放大攻击流量。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-21T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/944","http://www.securityfocus.com/templates/advisory.html?id=2041","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/72f387512fbbb3f0e46713b23cdbd1f9c533d1f7/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0095.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0095","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/7f1c35ad28226319c149c937b6a2e7a1986924ce/content/CVE-2000-0095.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/d67487551d3c04e5942b9b8e11c25937ecfba21c/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0095.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/0e291808cb617ccf4c842a91d82530cb507f8570/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-x4q4-xrjj-86w6/GHSA-x4q4-xrjj-86w6.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/1c14ae4816efb67123e0664d061a6cbfe48f234b/nvdcve/CVE-2000-0095.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_152100_152200.json","https://github.com/dong-xs/Vul-PAG/blob/7eb3b32094a5270cfd8495366e0e4a7df5a874ce/aspect_prediction/org_pred_diff.txt","https://github.com/RiskBasedPrioritization/RiskBasedPrioritizationAnalysis/blob/3d5cc1819ecb8cbc3aeb75d9a8260318544faf56/data_in/acme/acme_cves.csv"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0079.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0306","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0306.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0093","title":"Red Hat Linux 初始密码使用 DES 弱加密算法漏洞","description":"Red Hat Linux 在安装过程中默认使用 DES 加密算法配合 crypt() 函数对初始用户密码进行哈希处理，而非采用安全性更高的 MD5 算法。DES 算法密钥空间有限（56 位），易于被暴力破解或彩虹表攻击，攻击者在获取到 /etc/shadow 文件中的密码哈希后，可利用 DES 较弱的加密强度在较短时间内破解用户密码。该漏洞影响 Red Hat Linux 多个版本，属于加密算法强度不足导致的敏感信息泄露风险。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":10.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0093"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-01-21T05:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:50:59.167","remediation":"修改 /etc/login.defs 配置文件，将 ENCRYPT_METHOD 设为 MD5 或 SHA512（推荐 SHA512），并运行 authconfig --passalgo=sha512 --update 命令切换系统密码加密算法。同时使用 pwconv 命令重新加密现有用户口令。升级至 Red Hat Linux 6.2 及以上版本可获得 md5 密码支持。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-21T00:00:00Z","references":["https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/CVE-2000-0093","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/72f387512fbbb3f0e46713b23cdbd1f9c533d1f7/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0093.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0093","https://github.com/sari3l/Poc-Monitor/blob/922354cca15ef3923415d02f4397f929a0208531/2000/CVE-2000-0093.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/7f1c35ad28226319c149c937b6a2e7a1986924ce/content/CVE-2000-0093.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/0e291808cb617ccf4c842a91d82530cb507f8570/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-jpmj-rq8m-mfq3/GHSA-jpmj-rq8m-mfq3.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/d67487551d3c04e5942b9b8e11c25937ecfba21c/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0093.json","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x89000/88231/info.html","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_152100_152200.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/CVE-Easy-List/blob/5116d66f715b098d7dc74f3fb3559215242e5dbf/2000.tsv"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0306.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0300","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0300.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0091","title":"Inter7 vpopmail（vchkpw）POP认证组件缓冲区溢出漏洞","description":"Inter7 vpopmail 的 vchkpw POP 认证组件存在缓冲区溢出漏洞，远程攻击者可通过向 POP3 服务发送超长用户名或密码参数触发该漏洞，导致缓冲区溢出，从而以 root 权限执行任意代码。该漏洞影响 vpopmail 3.4.11 及更早版本，利用复杂度低，危害等级严重。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":10.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0091"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-01-21T05:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:50:58.910","remediation":"立即将 vpopmail 升级至 3.4.12 及以上版本，该版本已修复 vchkpw POP 认证模块中用户名/密码长度未校验导致的缓冲区溢出漏洞。如无法立即升级，可限制 POP3 服务的访问来源 IP，仅允许受信网段连接 110 端口作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-21T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.inter7.com/vpopmail/","http://www.inter7.com/vpopmail/ChangeLog","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/942","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/19727","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/72f387512fbbb3f0e46713b23cdbd1f9c533d1f7/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0091.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0091","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/7f1c35ad28226319c149c937b6a2e7a1986924ce/content/CVE-2000-0091.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/d67487551d3c04e5942b9b8e11c25937ecfba21c/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0091.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/0e291808cb617ccf4c842a91d82530cb507f8570/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-j7gx-8wqm-phgg/GHSA-j7gx-8wqm-phgg.json","https://github.com/blackhook/nessus-plugins/blob/64177d96abbb07c58cf7e131046b067ebc61fcb5/P/pop3_overflow.nasl","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_152100_152200.json","https://github.com/andreafioraldi/ToolsForCyberChallenge/blob/197d3dfd204cf1b9d1af1451455c8831c3ff9948/generated/files_4.list.dict","https://github.com/leego972/titanai/blob/afa5b2310463aae5781d3fd9408071bf38e79806/data/raw/corpus_D_cyber/nvd_cve_001112.txt","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/bc3b224aa865bb4a5c31d7720dca83e446e475e2/2000/CVE-2000-0091.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0300.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0098","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0098.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0115","title":"Microsoft IIS ASP Visual Basic Script 拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Microsoft IIS 在处理 ASP 页面中的 VBScript 脚本时，未对用户提供的正则表达式进行充分校验，导致本地攻击者可通过构造特殊的非法正则表达式触发服务崩溃。该漏洞影响 IIS 服务器，攻击者需拥有本地访问权限，利用方式简单，可导致 IIS 服务拒绝服务，影响网站正常访问。CVSS 评分 5.0，危害等级中等。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0115"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-01-21T05:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:51:01.897","remediation":"建议安装 Microsoft 安全公告 MS00-008 对应的补丁（Q246018），或升级至 Windows 2000 Service Pack 1 及以上版本。如暂无法打补丁，可在 IIS 管理控制台中将 ASP 脚本超时时间由默认 90 秒下调至 30 秒，并在「应用程序配置-调试」中关闭「启用 ASP 服务器端脚本调试」，以降低恶意正则导致的资源耗尽风险。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-21T00:00:00Z","references":["https://marc.info/?l=ntbugtraq&m=94881904724731&w=2","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/40188c20a9aa81abfbfb911b2