 97/2000）及 Office Converter Pack 2000 用户立即安装 MS00-002 公告提供的专用补丁，分别从对应区域的 Office Update 网站下载 Word 5 转换器更新包。若无法立即打补丁，应避免打开来路不明的东亚语言 Word 5 文档，并在注册表中禁用 Word 5 文档格式转换器作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-21T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/946","https://docs.microsoft.com/en-us/security-updates/securitybulletins/2000/ms00-002","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/7f33768789fe75b3288b56f0d11b0df1d5f4a5d4/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0088.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0088","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/7f1c35ad28226319c149c937b6a2e7a1986924ce/content/CVE-2000-0088.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/d67487551d3c04e5942b9b8e11c25937ecfba21c/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0088.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/32e7885f9dd6f50edc2a4b9aee21e32f55f76f84/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-v953-3rp8-5v5v/GHSA-v953-3rp8-5v5v.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_152100_152200.json","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--c0675c79-afb8-42ff-adb6-ddd71d517e29.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/bc3b224aa865bb4a5c31d7720dca83e446e475e2/2000/CVE-2000-0088.json","https://github.com/aboutcode-org/aboutcode-mirror-euvd/blob/e1fa268f46af70c043d8fa3850aa13f3adaa5831/advisories/2022/04/EUVD-2000-0087.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0073.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0076","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0076.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0092","title":"BSD make 竞争条件漏洞","description":"BSD make 程序在处理 -j 并行编译选项时存在符号链接竞争条件漏洞。本地攻击者可通过在 /tmp 目录下创建恶意符号链接，利用 make 程序在临时文件操作过程中的时间窗口，诱导程序向任意系统文件写入数据，从而导致权限提升或文件内容篡改。该漏洞影响多个 BSD 系统及衍生版本，CVSS 评分 6.2，危害等级中危。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":6.2,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0092"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-01-19T05:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:50:59.043","remediation":"升级 BSD make 至 1.x 以上版本（该漏洞已在后续版本修复），或改用 GNU Make 替代以避免 /tmp 竞争条件。临时缓解措施：避免在全局可写目录下以 -j 参数执行 make，并确保 make 工作目录的 sticky bit 已设置（chmod +t /tmp）。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-21T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/939","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/72f387512fbbb3f0e46713b23cdbd1f9c533d1f7/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0092.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0092","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/7f1c35ad28226319c149c937b6a2e7a1986924ce/content/CVE-2000-0092.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/d67487551d3c04e5942b9b8e11c25937ecfba21c/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0092.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/0e291808cb617ccf4c842a91d82530cb507f8570/advisories/unreviewed/2022/05/GHSA-vcw7-xgh4-9m7m/GHSA-vcw7-xgh4-9m7m.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/1c14ae4816efb67123e0664d061a6cbfe48f234b/nvdcve/CVE-2000-0092.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_152100_152200.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/CVE-Easy-List/blob/5116d66f715b098d7dc74f3fb3559215242e5dbf/2000.tsv","https://github.com/Vasileios-Mavroeidis/semantic-stix-vulnerability/blob/30f07606133364b9623f401bc306c8c9cbcf9386/vulnerability/vulnerability--94960d45-3530-49d5-82c9-b52791f833d8.owl"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0076.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0083","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0083.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0099","title":"SCO UnixWare ppptalk 缓冲区溢出漏洞","description":"UnixWare 的 ppptalk 命令存在缓冲区溢出漏洞，本地攻击者可通过向该命令提交超长的 prompt 参数触发缓冲区溢出，进而覆盖内存中的关键数据，导致权限提升至 root 级别。该漏洞影响 UnixWare 操作系统，CVSS 评分 7.2，危害等级高。成功利用此漏洞需要攻击者具有本地系统访问权限。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.2,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0099"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-01-18T05:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:50:59.913","remediation":"立即升级 UnixWare 至最新补丁级别，或安装 SCO 针对此漏洞发布的安全补丁。临时缓解措施：以 root 执行 `chmod 0755 /usr/bin/ppptalk` 移除 setuid 位，阻止普通用户提权；同时通过 `chmod 750` 限制 ppptalk 仅授信管理员可执行。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-21T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=94848865112897&w=2","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/3d8ee18720c8a74c03524a9994e81b2de7f6b0ec/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0099.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0099","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/7f1c35ad28226319c149c937b6a2e7a1986924ce/content/CVE-2000-0099.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/4dd512046a74ddd9ae16741caf0933056ffd666e/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0099.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/b029cc6cdc62926be1ff123d5ca2faba44641d8e/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-h7wm-7j5h-gr2f/GHSA-h7wm-7j5h-gr2f.json","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x84000/83017/info.html","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/1c14ae4816efb67123e0664d061a6cbfe48f234b/nvdcve/CVE-2000-0099.json","https://github.com/Yuning-J/VulnerabilityClassifier/blob/c0f06c21b73c26b5ee2b75c21a498eb04eada4b5/threatPrediction/cveIDThreatType/cve_